  <h2>🔍 Code Structure Overview</h2>
  <p>The countdown timer is built using three main components: HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Each component plays a crucial role in the timer's appearance and functionality.</p>

  <h3>📜 HTML Structure (index.html)</h3>
  <pre><code class='language-html'>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"&gt;
    &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt;
